  "events": [
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It was a sunny afternoon when the 7 year old William ran towards his parents’ room whilst crying. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "His steps echoed across the corridors of the manor before stopping in front of the wooden door, hands trembling as he knocked on the firmly closed door.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PlaySound",
      "sound": "door_knock"
    },
    {
      "name": "PlaySound",
      "sound": "sobbing",
      "loop": true
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "(hiks) Mother, father…",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Come in, William.",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PlaySound",
      "sound": "door_open"
    },
    {
      "name": "PlaySound",
      "sound": "rushed_footsteps"
    },
    {
      "name": "ChangeBackground",
      "background": "parents_bedroom"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The moment Charles’s voice echoed from inside the room, William didn’t wait for even a second and stumbled into the room with tear-streaked cheeks. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "He slouches his face onto the soft mattress as he sobs near where his father sat.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "expression": "sad",
      "position": "center"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Father, I-I can’t beat Nathan on horseback training today… ",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "(hiks)... ",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "I’ve practiced so hard… ",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "b-but why is he always better than me?",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "That afternoon, William and his older brother, Nathaniel, had horseback training with one of the trainers in the woods near the manor. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "While Nathaniel’s posture is elegant on his horseback when he rides, William got a lot of criticism from the trainer regarding that since he won’t stop wobbling to the sides whenever his horse gallops. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "In which, resulting him to stormed into his parents’ room and cried beside his father.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Charles watched his son for a long moment before reaching his hand to William’s hair and brushing it steadily.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "expression": "sad",
      "position": "left"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "expression": "happy",
      "position": "right"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You practiced horseback training again, son? ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "You really are a hard worker.",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "(hiks)... ",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "But, Father, I still wobble…",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You don’t have to master it immediately, William. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Training takes time and you still have a lot to learn, like your brother.",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "(hiks)... ",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "D-Do you think so? ",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "That… I can be as good as Nathan when I learn more?",
          "pacing": 0.075,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Of course you will, son.",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The moment his father said that, William lifts his head to meet Charles’s eyes, his gaze full of quiet hope of one day being better. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "His father stares at him back, then lowering his hand that was resting on William’s head down to the boy’s shoulder, gripping it firmly.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Besides, in this family, only the worthy ones deserve heaven. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "And I know that all of my children are worthy of that because you bear my last name. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "You hear me?",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "expression": "surprised",
      "position": "left"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Only the worthy ones deserve heaven… ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "thought",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Really?",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "thought",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Really.",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Only the worthy ones deserve heaven”. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "That’s enough to make the crying William forget his sadness as he gazes at his father like he hung the moon. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "The worthy ones, he thought, are the Blackwoods, including himself. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "He will deserve heaven, like his own brother and sister.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "William then stood up, wiping the remaining tears from his face with his sleeves a little aggressively from grit. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Looking back at his father with a soldier-like respect.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "expression": "happy",
      "position": "left"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then, I will continue learning so I can deserve heaven!",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "That’s the spirit! ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Go on, then.",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "William",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Thank you, father. ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "I love you!",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Without glancing twice at his father, William immediately rushed back through the door of his parents' room with a new insight that he, just like his other siblings, will always have a place in heaven if he’s trying hard to gain worth.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}